# A tuft of orange fur by the road (The Missing Cat). Format: dialogue/dialogue_parser.gd
@when cat_clue_1 -> again

== offer ==
A tuft of [color=#d9772b]orange fur[/color], snagged on the ground. Soft, and smells faintly of fish. [set cat_clue_1]
Biscuit was definitely here.

== again ==
Orange fur. Biscuit's, no doubt.
